SY_TALK("cSXiyg5XyUE",[[4,["Today we are talking about"]],[6,["the sixth chakra called as Agya Chakra."]],[26,["The ‘gya’, ‘gya’ word means ‘to know’, gya is to know."]],[32,["And ‘A’ means ‘the whole’."]],[37,["Agya chakra also has another meaning."]],[40,["A-gya,  agya means ‘obedience’ or ‘to order’."]],[48,["It can mean both the things. If you order to someone"]],[52,["it is an agya and the one who obeys the order is an agyakari."]],[57,["The one who does the agya."]],[63,["This sixth chakra was created in the human beings"]],[73,["when he started thinking."]],[77,["Thinking is language expressed."]],[91,["If we do not have a language we cannot think."]],[98,["But it does not mean there is no thought coming into us."]],[102,["If we cannot express it,"]],[106,["it does not mean there is no thought process working in us."]],[110,["But at that subtle stage when the thoughts are coming to us"]],[116,["they are not in language,"]],[121,["so they are not communicated to us,"]],[125,["and that’s why if we do not have language"]],[128,["we cannot understand what we are thinking."]],[136,["That’s why you must have seen children cannot communicate to us"]],[141,["what they want because they cannot say what they are wanting."]],[145,["They feel the urge in the stomach"]],[150,["and they want to ask for, say, water or something,"]],[154,["but they can’t say it to us,"]],[158,["and that’s why they cannot think what they have to say about."]],[165,["But afterwards when you start thinking"]],[171,["and putting it into language,"]],[173,["that language is stored in our brain as shown in the picture"]],[178,["on the left hand side and also on the right hand side"]],[183,["of that yellow and black, then it comes back to us,"]],[187,["later on as, thought waves. As if somebody is talking to us."]],[194,["But before the language starts,"]],[198,["we can call it the inspiration"]],[201,["or the thought process, at the very early stage,"]],[204,["comes to us in certain forms,"]],[209,["and those forms are in light and shade."]],[213,["They are not in language but in light and shade."]],[218,["And after coming to Sahaja Yoga"]],[220,["if you go deep into your thoughts"]],[223,["you’ll find they are nothing but lights and shade"]],[226,["that are covering our Agya chakra."]],[232,["One after another a light and shade, like a circular lighthouse,"]],[243,["they give a kind of a pattern in our head."]],[247,["Now these patterns are moulded into language"]],[253,["by us at a very early stage"]],[256,["and these are sort of filled into the cups of language"]],[260,["and then these cups are kept reserved in the brain"]],[264,["and they come to us that way."]],[268,["When we think we really understand"]],[272,["because it’s a language that comes to us."]],[275,["So what happens to the animals? Do they think or not?"]],[281,["They get a thought, an inspiration"]],[287,["but they won’t be just thinking about it."]],[291,["Now, these inspirations come to them"]],[294,["as words when they start living with human beings."]],[299,["So these inspirations go into the thought again as we do."]],[304,["For example you give somebody a name,"]],[306,["say you call him say Tom, or something – you call a dog"]],[311,["– so now he knows that this word means ‘calling me’."]],[316,["So he connects himself with that word."]],[319,["But when he does not have the word,"]],[322,["when he’s just an animal,"]],[324,["he’s just there, he doesn’t think."]],[330,["That’s why they are very spontaneous and we are not."]],[334,["Animals are extremely spontaneous that cause they do not"]],[340,["think the way we think."]],[343,["And this has created the greatest problem for human beings:"]],[347,["how to get beyond thoughts."]],[350,["It’s a little complicated thing because"]],[353,["perhaps I can see that very clearly,"]],[355,["as you cannot see the light."]],[358,["And then the light forms the language,"]],[362,["and then language, according to us, becomes our thoughts."]],[367,["But these thoughts are really conditionings on us"]],[371,["and they are not inspired things."]],[373,["They are not coming from inside"]],[376,["and that’s why we are not spontaneous."]],[380,["For example if I am sitting here,"]],[383,["now I cannot keep quiet as a human being."]],[386,["I’ll be thinking about something."]],[388,["I’ll be thinking, “What am I going to say?”"]],[391,["Then “Should I say this or not?”"]],[393,["“What if I say this, will that be alright or not?”"]],[395,["“Will that go to their heads or not?”"]],[397,["All sorts of thoughts will be coming into My head."]],[399,["Then from one side I will be questioning myself."]],[402,["From the other side the answers will be coming,"]],[404,["“Alright you say this and if you say like this"]],[407,["they may appreciate you Go this way that way they will understand.”"]],[411,["Like that you see. So the sorting out goes on"]],[413,["in our brain through our experiences of this lifetime of ours."]],[420,["Whatever have been our experiences in this lifetime"]],[423,["in dealing with people in getting experiences from others:"]],[427,["all these are conditioned into our brain"]],[430,["and the whole thing becomes a thought process,"]],[433,["which comes to us through this interaction of thought"]],[440,["and action, action and thought, which just starts waves"]],[444,["– which action to take, what thought to be put in,"]],[446,["how to solve it and we think we are analysing ourselves."]],[450,["It’s a very superficial thing."]],[454,["Actually you do not analyse anything whatsoever, you do not."]],[460,["As I told you the other day you do not do anything."]],[464,["So your thinking is nothing but a bubbling going on."]],[468,["Because when, like a sea even, which is, so deep down, so quiet"]],[473,["– when it touches the shore it has a action and reaction."]],[476,["In the same way when you are seeing at something,"]],[480,["because your attention is outside,"]],[483,["immediately a thought wave is created out of that,"]],[485,["which goes back and gives you all the images about it,"]],[489,["whatever you know about that particular thing"]],[492,["and it comes back to you as thought process."]],[496,["It’s going on all the time,"]],[501,["and it can be so maddening that we cannot stop our thoughts:"]],[505,["it just goes on like mad."]],[507,["You don’t know, you can’t sleep because thoughts are coming."]],[510,["Sometimes they could be horrifying,"]],[512,["sometimes they are gratifying, sometimes romantic,"]],[515,["sometimes absolutely negative, sometimes very positive."]],[520,["Sometimes you feel “I must do this,”"]],[522,["sometimes you feel “I shouldn’t do this”."]],[525,["But when you [are] actually doing – you do not think."]],[530,["It’s surprising, we never notice"]],[532,["that when we are doing that particular thing,"]],[535,["supposing I say I am going to speak, these things."]],[539,["Now when I’ve thought about it that I thought say about 10 minutes"]],[542,["before when I’m speaking it, I am not thinking that"]],[545,["what I was going to speak."]],[547,["Because that time I think I’ve built in that process of thinking"]],[552,["into my brain and put it somewhere stored"]],[554,["and then, now,  when I have started this talk,"]],[557,["that is coming direct to me."]],[561,["So human beings have developed, I should say a process,"]],[565,["which can be a very sickening thing, very, very sickening."]],[571,["And this comes out of both of these."]],[574,["Is one the left side that we call the ego, which has gone this side"]],[578,["and the right side we call the superego."]],[582,["All the conditioning on the right hand side of the superego,"]],[588,["is, gives us, the fears, the dangers, the possibilities."]],[594,["Whatever we have experienced before."]],[597,["As they say those who have been burnt by"]],[601,["milk also [will] take a cold drink after blowing it a little."]],[608,["Because you have been burnt you know"]],[611,["something liquid has burnt you so you think this may also"]],[614,["burn your tongue. So you may try to do that."]],[617,["It is so spontaneous that time that you feel that,"]],[621,["“Oh it is very spontaneous”, but it is not.","It has been stored before"]],[624,["in your experiences and something there"]],[627,["that you are afraid of and that’s why you do it."]],[630,["If we, once, realise that this thought process is"]],[634,["absolutely not necessary for us to exist."]],[642,["There is no need to have any thought"]],[646,["about the future or about","the past if you want to exist as human beings."]],[653,["Animals do not bother."]],[655,["For example animals know that they are going in a jungle."]],[660,["Now suddenly they find some other animal coming from there"]],[663,["and they know that you go there."]],[665,["Now what’s the use of thinking","about the animal that is going to come?"]],[670,["Supposing it does not come then it’s such a waste."]],[673,["But they have a hole here and they no problem as we have"]],[677,["because have a hole the whole thing goes out."]],[679,["It doesn’t stick for more than a minute here."]],[681,["But you can condition them also."]],[684,["By experiences they are conditioned."]],[687,["By experiences that they have had so far,"]],[689,["about other animals and things, they are conditioned."]],[692,["And they act accordingly."]],[695,["So there’s a tremendous difference between us"]],[697,["and them is that we think about everything."]],[701,["I mean, we think it is a very great","thing to sit down and think about it."]],[706,["And we think it is very wise to sit down and think about it."]],[710,["Any problem comes in you think,","“Better sit down and think about it.”"]],[716,["But now what do we do when a problem arrives?"]],[720,["We think about it"]],[721,["in relation to whatever we have been doing before"]],[726,["and whatever our experiences have been."]],[729,["In the same way they want to think about Sahaja Yoga."]],[734,["Now you cannot think about Sahaja Yoga."]],[737,["First of all you become thoughtlessly aware","in Sahaja Yoga to begin with."]],[741,["You cannot think."]],[743,["But it is a happening about which you cannot think."]],[747,["It is a living happening, thinking is a dead movement,"]],[752,["it is not a living movement."]],[757,["Whatever [is] dead in us comes back to us as thought."]],[763,["Inspiration is living, not the thinking."]],[768,["Inspiration is very different from the thought."]],[775,["For example, books are in the library,"]],[778,["everything that we have thought of or"]],[781,["have got it or experienced – this is in the books."]],[785,["Whatever is new coming to us is the inspiration."]],[791,["Now just find out how many new things you are thinking,"]],[799,["perhaps not even a sentence."]],[802,["Mostly you say that “This gentleman said so,”"]],[806,["“That gentleman said so,” “That gentleman said so”,"]],[809,["or “I said so”."]],[814,["If you can think about that is coming just now into you,"]],[819,["you don’t have to think for it, it just comes out,"]],[825,["it is inside you, it just emerges and expresses itself."]],[831,["So that is the spontaneous living thing."]],[835,["That is what we call as inspiration:"]],[838,["is a sudden glimpse of the knowledge that we get."]],[841,["But whatever we have [been] thinking about"]],[844,["is all the play of the dead."]],[852,["So this is a centre of Christ."]],[856,["He resides in the centre of Agya,"]],[862,["and He is, in the Devi Purana if you read,"]],[867,["was born long, long time before, was created much earlier"]],[872,["and how He developed into Mahavishnu","also you can read it for yourself"]],[876,["because it’s a big chapter and I wish"]],[879,["you all could know and read about it and find out"]],[882,["how He developed into Mahavishnu."]],[885,["It is very interesting."]],[887,["Because all these things were written in Sanskrit language,"]],[891,["we should not say that Mahavishnu was not in the Bible,"]],[899,["because Bible itself was not written at a stretch by one person."]],[902,["So that part is a part of Christ’s creation before He came"]],[908,["on this Earth as Christ."]],[912,["Actually Christians do not know anything about His becoming:"]],[916,["how He became Christ or what was the need to have Christ"]],[922,["or a son to come down [and] why not God Himself could do the job."]],[927,["And this is the reason why I would request you"]],[929,["to read for yourself the incarnation of Mahavishnu"]],[935,["by which you realise why Christ was born."]],[940,["And it is the most important incarnation"]],[945,["because He is the principle,"]],[951,["He is the principle of creation,"]],[955,["the tattwa, as they call it in Sanskrit language, He is the tattwa."]],[960,["Ganesha, though resides in the Mooladhara gradually evolves"]],[967,["to be Christ at this stage."]],[970,["From that red chakra up to this chakra He becomes Christ."]],[978,["He is the principle."]],[980,["Now what is the principle?"]],[986,["Within us what is our principle?"]],[989,["Is, say, the Kundalini you can say."]],[993,["In this (microphone) the electricity is","the principle of this one is."]],[997,["In the same way the creation,"]],[1000,["the whole creation if you take it as such,"]],[1003,["it is the principle and the support of this creation."]],[1010,["He represents the essence, the essence of creation."]],[1022,["Like we can say we have a family,"]],[1025,["husband and wife and the child."]],[1028,["Now the child is the essence of husband and wife,"]],[1034,["he’s the essence of the family, of the house."]],[1039,["The whole thing is sustained for him, is created for him."]],[1045,["Till they did not have the child there was no meaning to that house"]],[1052,["no meaning to their life."]],[1054,["But when they had a child then they had a meaning. In the same way,"]],[1058,["Christ is the essence, is the tattwa itself."]],[1062,["He’s the Omkara as they call it. He is the first sound,"]],[1068,["first sound that was created – Om –"]],[1070,["when the Primordial Father and Primordial Mother separated,"]],[1075,["They created this sound."]],[1077,["And He is that sound which is filled into All-Pervading Power"]],[1083,["and looks after and supports."]],[1088,["Actually it is more the support","because looking after is done by the Father"]],[1092,["you can say or by the Mother."]],[1093,["But is the support of all the Universe."]],[1101,["And because He is just the essence, the essence never dies."]],[1108,["Say My essence is My Spirit, it will never die."]],[1114,["The body dies or the creation will die","but the essence has to be there."]],[1120,["If the essence is lost then nothing could be there."]],[1123,["That’s why He’s the most important incarnation,"]],[1127,["because He is the support."]],[1131,["Now this incarnation is placed in this Agya chakra of ours,"]],[1137,["here in the centre, where the optic nerve or optic thalamus cross"]],[1142,["each other like this. In the centre is a very subtle point"]],[1147,["which moves both the sides like this and like that"]],[1150,["and it creates two sounds","‘hum’  ‘kshum’,  ‘hum’   ‘kshum’,  ‘hum’   ‘kshum’."]],[1158,["‘Hum’ is on the right hand side where you have seen"]],[1163,["the superego is there"]],[1166,["and  ‘kshum’  is on the left hand side where the ego is."]],[1171,["Now these two sounds create two kinds of vibrations."]],[1179,["The ‘hum’ sound creates the vibrations,"]],[1187,["which make you think, “I am, I am”"]],[1191,["‘hum’, ‘I am.’"]],[1193,["This comes from our existence power"]],[1196,["that we know we have to live in this world,"]],[1199,["we’re not going to die."]],[1201,["Any human being who tries to kill himself is abnormal."]],[1205,["Normally every human being…"]],[1208,["why every animal or any living thing tries to retain its life?"]],[1214,["That is through this power of ‘hum’,  that – ‘I am’."]],[1219,["Now the superego on the left hand side"]],[1221,["and ego on the right hand side is kshum’."]],[1225,["But now I’ll tell you about the right hand side – superego."]],[1230,["In this superego when you are conditioned by so many things,"]],[1240,["then you are frightened and you are worried"]],[1244,["because these experiences make you that"]],[1248,["type of a person which has fear in the mind."]],[1252,["And this fear is all settled in your superego."]],[1256,["This starts from your amoeba stage you can say"]],[1259,["and is, still today, is being stored there."]],[1261,["You are afraid of police,","you are afraid of that, you are afraid of this."]],[1265,["Some people are not afraid of","these things but are afraid of something else,"]],[1269,["because whatever have been your conditions,"]],[1273,["whatever have been your experiences, are all put down here."]],[1279,["Moreover when somebody reads the book of Dracula"]],[1282,["now he’s afraid of the word Dracula"]],[1284,["but the children who do not read"]],[1285,["they do not know what is a Dracula is."]],[1287,["If you say Dracula has come they say,"]],[1289,["“Alright, lets have a look at him!”"]],[1291,["But those children [who] have read about Dracula,"]],[1294,["they are literally frightened and they say, “Oh God,"]],[1296,["Dracula is coming, something terrible is going to happen!”"]],[1299,["So, whatever you have read, whatever you have gone through"]],[1303,["whatever experiences you have had – all is in the superego."]],[1308,["So this superego in that, this centre, sends [this] message,"]],[1316,["“I am, you are, you are”, ‘hum’,  ‘hum’ : “don’t be afraid,"]],[1321,["don’t be afraid”, “you are”."]],[1323,["So the people who come to Me, and you have seen some people"]],[1327,["who come to Me are victims of superego conditioning."]],[1333,["And these are the people…"]],[1334,["actually at this stage only, you can really discriminate"]],[1338,["between the two types:"]],[1339,["one who are very aggressive, the other who are absolutely"]],[1343,["we should say subordinated, frightened."]],[1350,["These people when they come to Me,"]],[1353,["I have seen, they go on crying and weeping,"]],[1355,["“Mother you know this has happened that has happened,”"]],[1359,["and I really get tired talking to them."]],[1362,["And there are so many of this kind that"]],[1366,["really you have to pay attention to them as sahaja yogis"]],[1369,["because you’ll have to deal with them,"]],[1371,["how to manage them and how to work it out."]],[1374,["Now at that time if a sahaja yogi says,"]],[1377,["now you go on saying ‘hum’, ‘hum’, ‘hum’, ‘hum’,"]],[1381,["a sahaja yogi, if he says [that],","then the vibrations will drive out his fear."]],[1387,["Even if you are under any fear"]],[1389,["and you are walking around and you feel that there’s frightened,"]],[1393,["you just say ‘hum’, ‘hum’, ‘hum’."]],[1395,["Now with this saying the vibrations will clear out"]],[1399,["this side very nicely."]],[1402,["Apart from that,"]],[1404,["that is the way you can get help from the Divine by saying ‘hum’."]],[1409,["Now there are many things about","hum and kshum but as the time is you know,"]],[1413,["so I do not want to go into great details about it."]],[1417,["But I would say the mantra for the right hand side is ‘hum’"]],[1421,["and for the left hand side is ‘kshum’."]],[1426,["The right hand side is the ego,"]],[1428,["which is real problem, you understand that!"]],[1431,["Is a real colossal one you have to face them, I mean,"]],[1436,["[if] I say anything small here and there"]],[1438,["I find the whole thing coming up onto my head like that."]],[1442,["So what is the solution for a colossal ego?"]],[1446,["Colossal ego can only be conquered by forgiving others."]],[1454,["Those who have ego must learn,"]],[1459,["if they feel hurt they must say, “forgive.”"]],[1462,["Then another person hurts them, say, “forgive.”"]],[1466,["And not only forgive but ask for forgiveness."]],[1470,["Both things should be done, more asking for forgiveness."]],[1474,["You have to ask for forgiveness if you have too much of ego."]],[1478,["It is very important. Because if you have too much of ego"]],[1481,["means what? That you have pampered it too much."]],[1485,["That means you have used it too much."]],[1488,["You have dominated people"]],[1490,["and that’s why you have such a lot of ego."]],[1493,["If you have such a lot of ego"]],[1495,["you must all the time try to humble down in your heart."]],[1499,["Now in the heart resides the Spirit."]],[1503,["The ego, too much of ego in a person,"]],[1506,["always takes you away from that Spirit."]],[1509,["That’s why it is said, “Humble down in your heart.”"]],[1513,["The reason is, in the heart resides that part of yours"]],[1517,["which gets completely obliterated or forgotten"]],[1522,["once you start pumping up your ego."]],[1526,["But ego has its limits, it ends up into stupidity and foolishness."]],[1532,["You take any person who is egoistical"]],[1536,["and who’s blowing his own trumpet,"]],[1539,["you will immediately know because he’ll be stupid,"]],[1543,["without understanding what he’s doing,"]],[1546,["he’ll be doing such stupid things"]],[1548,["that you will start wondering, especially children,"]],[1551,["“What’s the matter with this fellow? Seems quite funny!”"]],[1556,["And then the stupidity faces the person"]],[1559,["– then he sees for himself, “Oh God! how did I become so stupid?”"]],[1565,["But stupidity comes to you"]],[1567,["because you forget the existence of God"]],[1570,["and your relationship with the Whole."]],[1575,["You think, “I am on my own."]],[1577,["Why should I not do this?"]],[1579,["What is wrong in this,"]],[1581,["what is wrong in that?"]],[1583,["I should do these things.”"]],[1585,["I mean in this country the way people are fighting for things,"]],[1588,["I mean, you must, anybody, I mean, those so-called"]],[1591,["developing countries can’t understand:"]],[1594,["what’s this kind of a thing happening to these people?"]],[1597,["Because the other day My son-in-law Luv was reading an article"]],[1603,["that people are demanding now that a son-in-law"]],[1606,["should be allowed to marry the mother-in-law"]],[1609,["and he just couldn’t understand how can people gather together"]],[1612,["and ask for such an absurd thing like that."]],[1615,["She is your mother. How can you say that way?"]],[1618,["I mean it is something an impossibility"]],[1620,["for people, normal people to think like that,"]],[1624,["that a son-in-law can marry the mother-in-law."]],[1626,["And what is there to make a law about it and to talk about it."]],[1629,["It’s a very difficult thing."]],[1631,["All kinds of stupid things we are doing in this country,"]],[1635,["which really makes everybody roar with laughter."]],[1639,["Is because of our Mr. Ego companionship."]],[1645,["It is not easy to understand how he befools us."]],[1649,["It goes on befooling us all the time"]],[1652,["and then we think “what’s wrong?”"]],[1654,["An eighty-year-old man"]],[1656,["running after a twenty-year-old girl."]],[1658,["And the twenty-year-old girl befooling this eighty-year-old man,"]],[1662,["supposed to be a statesman this, that"]],[1665,["and his statue is erected somewhere there."]],[1668,["How is it possible?"]],[1672,["It is only the ego makes you do"]],[1675,["all these nonsensical and stupid things."]],[1679,["Once you are in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1681,["you don’t know how to control your laughter sometimes,"]],[1684,["the way people are foolish, extremely foolish."]],[1687,["And this is what it is; it ends up in stupidity absolute stupidity."]],[1692,["I mean even if you want to write"]],[1695,["a novel you won’t get such beautiful characters"]],[1698,["as you could around you,"]],[1700,["when you listen to them. And you’re shocked,"]],[1702,["“Oh God what’s this going on!”"]],[1703,["And very embarrassing too, extremely embarrassing."]],[1707,["And they become so foolish with their ego"]],[1715,["that one cannot understand how thinking man,"]],[1720,["because by thinking you get your ego, becomes foolish."]],[1726,["There is no wisdom"]],[1729,["in a person whose ego is completely developed like that."]],[1733,["If somebody has an ego like that there is no wisdom in him."]],[1737,["You can see that he does not know what is wisdom."]],[1741,["He behaves in such an immature way."]],[1744,["He may be an elderly man,"]],[1746,["great grandfather of somebody but"]],[1748,["as soon as he opens his mouth you are shocked at him."]],[1751,["You think from where this joker has come?"]],[1754,["The maturity is completely lacking."]],[1757,["The other day somebody told Me that,"]],[1759,["“Mother how is it our parents are so stupid"]],[1763,["and we are searching God?"]],[1766,["And the elderly people are so foolish and we are searching God?”"]],[1771,["And then I said,"]],[1772,["“No, maybe because of war the parents are disturbed."]],[1775,["Most of the parents were disturbed during war”"]],[1777,["and they said, “Majority of them are like this."]],[1780,["And the younger people are searching God and much wiser"]],[1784,["and we don’t know how to compromise with them"]],[1786,["because they are not searching God."]],[1788,["Why is it they are not searching God and we are searching God?"]],[1791,["And if there are some searching, they are very few.”"]],[1795,["Now I said this may be due to war but somebody said,"]],[1798,["“Then what about America? You see,"]],[1800,["in America the people didn’t face war so much,”"]],[1803,["the stupidity that they have is sometimes surprising."]],[1809,["That is the same thing as I said,"]],[1812,["is the development of ego in a human being."]],[1816,["Now ego is the thing that makes you think about everything."]],[1821,["For example, now we have to say go from here to Birmingham alright."]],[1828,["So we think now, “how will I go?”"]],[1831,["Simple way is that I’ll take a train or I’ll take a car and go away"]],[1836,["If there’s no reservation needed I will just jump into the train"]],[1839,["or go by the car. If the car is available I’ll go by car"]],[1842,["or by train finished! What is there to think about?"]],[1846,["But “No! Then we must plan it out, I have programmed! Now,"]],[1850,["I have to go!”"]],[1851,["You go to the station and find the train is not there"]],[1854,["because there was some accident so the train is not moving."]],[1858,["So you’re absolutely upset"]],[1860,["because you think that “The train has gone now what to do.?”"]],[1863,["In that upsetting you do not even remember that"]],[1866,["you have a car and you have to go by the car now."]],[1869,["That whole thing upsets you"]],[1872,["because you had plans to go by train"]],[1874,["and you had planned everything, now you cannot reach there"]],[1877,["and what will happen?"]],[1879,["Now you are sitting here and worrying about it."]],[1883,["As a person who is spontaneous what will he do?"]],[1886,["“Alright depends on, I may go by train or by car"]],[1889,["whatever I feel like at that time.”"]],[1891,["He’s sitting tight."]],[1893,["So he goes to the train,"]],[1895,["sees if the train is there."]],[1896,["If it is, nicely there’s a space available, he gets into it."]],[1901,["If the train is not available, alright,"]],[1903,["he comes home takes his car and goes away."]],[1906,["So now you have informed the people that"]],[1909,["you must meet at such and such a place – that also is there,."]],[1912,["So those people are running up, down there"]],[1914,["– and they will be there at the station."]],[1916,["Now what’s the matter?"]],[1918,["Even if they’re at the station you can meet them at the station."]],[1921,["You go by train and you can meet them."]],[1923,["What is there to be that much upset about it?"]],[1925,["You see you can always contact them."]],[1928,["But the way we get upset"]],[1930,["we have spoiled the complete program"]],[1932,["of going to Birmingham,"]],[1934,["which is a very beautiful program that we have got."]],[1938,["We have to meet new people, we have to meet many people,"]],[1940,["we have to enjoy ourselves."]],[1942,["That’s all finished!"]],[1943,["Because we had planned something and it did not work out,"]],[1947,["we are finished!"]],[1949,["All these things make us a miserable person."]],[1954,["And we are so miserable and so grudging and so boring"]],[1958,["that those who are next to you just get fed up with it and they say"]],[1962,["“Now shut up!"]],[1964,["If you are not going to Birmingham,"]],[1967,["if you are not going don’t go. But don’t eat my head now!”"]],[1971,["is a common experience of many."]],[1974,["It’s this Mr. Ego he’s so, he doesn’t want you to be happy."]],[1980,["He doesn’t want you to be relaxed."]],[1983,["He all the time gives you ideas and tells you,"]],[1986,["“Do this and do that and you must get it done","and this is to be done."]],[1990,["You had better inform that person,"]],[1992,["be meticulous about it,” and it will go to such details"]],[1995,["that anything fails you are finished"]],[1998,["because your nerves are already finished and shattered."]],[2001,["Anything, even a drop of"]],[2004,["inconvenience comes into you"]],[2006,["or even a feather of disturbance is there, you are finished."]],[2011,["And so everybody is rattling,"]],[2013,["“We have tensions. We have problems.” Why?"]],[2021,["What is the advantage of doing all these things?"]],[2025,["No advantage you know that. But then why do you do it?"]],[2029,["Because you have a big ego, it won’t allow you to rest."]],[2033,["Whatever you may try it won’t. So what is the solution of that?"]],[2037,["Morning till evening ask for forgiveness from God."]],[2041,["Pull your ears from both the sides"]],[2043,["and say, “Oh God, forgive me. Oh God, forgive me."]],[2046,["And, oh God forgive me,”"]],[2048,["so this balloon of ego goes down a little."]],[2052,["Remember Him morning, evening, every time."]],[2056,["Remembering Christ brings down your ego very much."]],[2061,["He did everything that was possible"]],[2064,["that you should not develop your ego."]],[2066,["Everything that was possible."]],[2068,["He was born as an ordinary carpenter’s son,"]],[2073,["lived in the most ordinary conditions,"]],[2077,["kept Himself behind the whole scene."]],[2082,["He could have been born as a Roman Emperor."]],[2086,["He could have been anybody there."]],[2089,["But no He was born Himself."]],[2092,["You know that He took his birth"]],[2094,["in a place where even ordinary people do not take their births."]],[2101,["But, there also the light was there."]],[2104,["Wherever He was born there was light and joy."]],[2108,["And this is the thing we have to know,"]],[2111,["that we have lost the joy because we have forgotten God Almighty."]],[2117,["When we forget Him,"]],[2120,["that He is love and He is joy, naturally joy is also forgotten."]],[2127,["And then we see people are not at all happy;"]],[2130,["they have affluence, they have money, they have everything,"]],[2133,["but still they are not happy."]],[2135,["All the time they are in such a mess"]],[2139,["that you don’t know how to talk to them."]],[2141,["If you say this word they’ll be angry,"]],[2143,["if you say that word they’ll be angry."]],[2146,["They are not at all normal human beings,"]],[2149,["they are sick people. Sick with their ego."]],[2154,["Is a very simple thing is to ask for forgiveness,"]],[2158,["but how many times do we do that?"]],[2161,["Not even once a day, not even once a month,"]],[2166,["not even once a year."]],[2168,["Even on a Christmas day if we could say,"]],[2171,["“Forgive us Oh Lord for whatever we have done so far.”"]],[2176,["It will work out."]],[2177,["But that day we must champagne to forgive Him more."]],[2183,["So we must have gossips and"]],[2185,["we must have all the arrogant things"]],[2188,["by the time it is the end of Christmas."]],[2196,["This ego, yellow side one,"]],[2199,["is the one that presses your superego too much. It does."]],[2204,["It presses it so much sometimes"]],[2206,["that a person forgets that others are hurt by what they talk."]],[2212,["On the contrary they devise methods"]],[2215,["how to say things which are cutting,"]],[2220,["which are hurting, which are painful to others."]],[2224,["They say such things, I mean all the time if you see,"]],[2228,["a person say from a village"]],[2230,["if he comes and sees he’ll think, are they quarreling,"]],[2233,["what are they doing? I mean the whole discussion,"]],[2235,["even in the parliament, I was surprised"]],[2238,["the way they talked to each other,"]],[2240,["no bull will treat another bull that way!"]],[2245,["Even a dog normally does not bark at another dog."]],[2251,["No animal in the world all the time is barking at its fellow man."]],[2256,["No animal in the whole world I can tell you this much."]],[2259,["Only the human beings"]],[2261,["if two people are there all the time they are going, “ha ha ha ha”"]],[2263,["all the time, that way."]],[2265,["How is it possible?"]],[2267,["His ego and"]],[2269,["her ego or maybe both his ego are dashing at each other."]],[2274,["And there is a kind of a"]],[2279,["funny type of feeling that"]],[2281,["“Oh I have mastered the thing,"]],[2284,["I have got the thing, I have got the point."]],[2286,["I have proved the point!”"]],[2289,["But in that I have lost everything"]],[2292,["that was so beautiful and so much joy giving within me."]],[2296,["Actually a sensible person would recede from the place"]],[2301,["where two people are having an argument."]],[2303,["Argument is a sign of tomfoolery."]],[2309,["I haven’t seen any argument coming to any end whatsoever."]],[2313,["If it is then it is alright, but it never does come."]],[2317,["Because, if say, you ask Me questions I answer you, alright."]],[2323,["If you do not like the answer give it up."]],[2326,["But if you argue with Me still"]],[2328,["and I argue with you where will you end?"]],[2331,["Argument is not going to lead you to any knowledge"]],[2335,["but a very terrible ego developing into you."]],[2341,["The whole modern concept is ego-oriented."]],[2347,["All western countries are ego-orientated."]],[2350,["They want to develop your ego and pamper it."]],[2353,["There are so many other ways by which they do."]],[2356,["Why I’m talking more about it [is] because we are"]],[2358,["all supposed to be western people and affluent people."]],[2361,["Supposed to be very wise and leading or misleading,"]],[2364,["I don’t know, the developing countries."]],[2367,["So we have to understand ourselves"]],[2369,["where are we as far as our understanding of things are concerned."]],[2373,["How ego is pampered within us is by a large-scale methods."]],[2380,["They work on your ego throughout to have all these"]],[2383,["so-called enterprises."]],[2385,["For example to a woman they’ll say,"]],[2387,["“Oh you must have a waist like this and you must have"]],[2390,["a face like this and you must have…”"]],[2392,["For a man, “You must this kind of a body."]],[2395,["You should be Mr. Universe or you should be something,”"]],[2398,["so the man starts working on it, immediately."]],[2401,["You must. There so many people I have seen running on the roads"]],[2404,["in this cold, I don’t understand."]],[2406,["Like mad, you know, and some of them are Members of Parliament!"]],[2408,["The whole night they keep awake","and the whole day they are running about. ."]],[2411,["I say – what are you doing? What is the need to do this?"]],[2415,["“To keep good health you must do it.”"]],[2418,["To keep good health don’t work like mad,"]],[2420,["be a sensible and a wise person."]],[2425,["Wisdom is to be sought to keep good health,"]],[2428,["to be alright and not this kind of mad ego-orientated things"]],[2433,["So then, the one way is to excite your ego about your physique."]],[2439,["Then there is ego about, you must have a big car."]],[2443,["You see, people try to show off their possessions."]],[2446,["You have a big car, then they’re going about."]],[2448,["I mean they really look, to Me, like jokers. That’s all they are."]],[2452,["I mean, car I can understand is a convenience"]],[2455,["and a good quality car, if somebody can afford, should have it,"]],[2458,["because it is a headache to have a bad car. So it’s alright."]],[2461,["But by having a car you become something great."]],[2464,["You may not have food in the house but you must have"]],[2467,["a very good car to go about. And all these ideas come."]],[2471,["Then they will advertise"]],[2473,["– “This will be a very good car for you.”"]],[2475,["What is it for you? It is nothing but to pamper your ego."]],[2479,["All these advertisements are nothing"]],[2481,["but by which your ego is pampered."]],[2484,["All these things they are created."]],[2486,["Now in America, if you go, every handle has to be different,"]],[2489,["every thing has to be different."]],[2490,["Why so much difference in everything?"]],[2493,["Why do you want to have everything so different?"]],[2496,["Is it some aesthetics, you think in that?"]],[2499,["It is none of the aesthetics but is just to pamper your ego."]],[2504,["Even the so-called art connoisseurs are nothing"]],[2508,["but ego-pamperers."]],[2509,["Your stamp collections, this, that"]],[2512,["– all this is nothing but ego pampering."]],[2514,["And what a waste of time, you just think about it."]],[2519,["This ego thing comes into us"]],[2523,["because we are, first of all, as I said, that, in the West,"]],[2528,["the living was very difficult, they had to fight the nature."]],[2531,["And when you have to fight the nature"]],[2533,["you have to develop your ego to fight it."]],[2536,["Or actually, when you are fighting the nature,"]],[2538,["the ego develops within you."]],[2541,["And then, once that momentum has started in you,"]],[2544,["it is very difficult to bring it down."]],[2546,["It is such a terrible disease"]],[2550,["that people have taken it for granted"]],[2553,["that that’s a part of their lives."]],[2555,["You are not your ego. You are not."]],[2559,["When I say that you must surrender yourself to God"]],[2563,["they say  “Mother why should we surrender?”"]],[2565,["‘Yourself’ means that ego with which you are identified."]],[2569,["I don’t say that you surrender your wisdom."]],[2574,["Or I can say: surrender your ego to your wisdom."]],[2578,["But it is so difficult to give it up,"]],[2581,["because we have learnt to live with it, identified with it."]],[2585,["We just cannot think of life without our ego, we just cannot."]],[2590,["And it is gone to such an extent"]],[2593,["that we don’t even realise how far we have gone in cruelty."]],[2599,["Like, “I like this kind, I like that kind.”"]],[2603,["You go to somebody’s house and you say like this:"]],[2605,["is indecent to talk like that."]],[2611,["It is vulgar to express, “I like…” Who are you?"]],[2616,["Are you God?"]],[2618,["“I want this. I want that. I am very particular about this."]],[2623,["I am very…”  Who are you?"]],[2627,["Just ask yourself a question, “Who am I? I am the Spirit."]],[2634,["I am that eternal being."]],[2637,["Have I become that?”"]],[2641,["On the contrary we are hurting everybody’s Spirit by our ego."]],[2646,["Every moment, when we talk to others, we are hurting them."]],[2651,["Actually people have lost faith in God,"]],[2655,["because those who are in charge of God are so arrogant"]],[2659,["and so egoistical"]],[2662,["that it has become impossible for anybody to think of God,"]],[2666,["which is beyond your ego."]],[2670,["You’ll be surprised, ego is absolutely superficial like a bubble."]],[2675,["It is just like a balloon, which can burst just like that!"]],[2680,["And it should go."]],[2683,["It should go so that you should rise."]],[2686,["It should disappear so that your attention rises in your Spirit"]],[2693,["and that you see the whole world as a part"]],[2697,["of that Spirit that you are."]],[2700,["This is the boundary, which you have to cross"]],[2703,["and for that we have to take help from Christ."]],[2707,["Christ crucified himself. Why? Because what did He do?"]],[2715,["Did He loot people?"]],[2716,["Today you have thousands of these"]],[2718,["thugs coming here and looting you:"]],[2721,["nobody crucifies them. What did He do?"]],[2726,["He just challenged the ego of these Romans"]],[2732,["and of these Jews,"]],[2734,["those who were angry with Him,"]],[2737,["and that’s why He was crucified."]],[2741,["And we have to crucify our ego now through His cross,"]],[2747,["otherwise we are going to do the same again to ourselves that,"]],[2752,["in our own being, we crucify our Christ by our ego."]],[2758,["It is a very symbolic death of Christ."]],[2761,["His birth in the most humble place, in a very humble place."]],[2766,["He is born in the optic thalamus, you can say:"]],[2769,["is the place where there brain, all activities coming and,"]],[2773,["all the, all sorts of problems there,","facing you, and there He lives."]],[2779,["And you have to just awaken Him there so that your ego"]],[2785,["is crucified once for all."]],[2787,["But I don’t say, “You fight your ego,”"]],[2790,["because it is not that important to fight."]],[2792,["You are fighting with your shadow."]],[2794,["You have shadow, which is called as ego:"]],[2797,["Which is not to be fought and to waste your energy on him."]],[2801,["There’s no need to fight him."]],[2803,["Only thing [is], if you stand in the centre of the light"]],[2806,["– you don’t see any shadow. It is so simple as that."]],[2809,["If you stand in the centre of light that is Christ,"]],[2812,["you don’t see any shadow anywhere."]],[2814,["But when I say this I may sound like other people who give sermons,"]],[2817,["“Stand in the shadow of Christ”"]],[2819,["or “ Stand in the light of Christ.” Now what does that mean?"]],[2823,["Where is that light, where is that place where you should stand?"]],[2828,["And that place is here in the centre of your"]],[2833,["optic thalamus where there is no thought."]],[2837,["You have to stand in thoughtless awareness."]],[2841,["(interruption in talk)…"]],[2843,["(Many people who have had a problem with Agya..."]],[2847,["... many people who have come…)"]],[2851,["thoughts will stop and they will be beyond thought."]],[2855,["And this a very, very important chakra for sahaja yogis"]],[2860,["because when the Kundalini rises above,"]],[2864,["above the Agya chakra – immediately there is no thought."]],[2867,["You do not get any thoughts from ego or superego."]],[2872,["But there is a wobbling in the Agya"]],[2874,["because of your imbalanced ways."]],[2878,["And the imbalanced ways are,"]],[2879,["that sometimes you are with ego or with superego."]],[2883,["This has happened to our people in the West"]],[2886,["because we have had so much of ego"]],[2888,["[that] we got really tired of it. We got frightened with it."]],[2891,["Then we started taking to drugs and things"]],[2894,["to increase our superego."]],[2898,["But by doing that, what we are doing is pushing by one end"]],[2901,["bringing by another end"]],[2903,["and that’s how we are wobbling our ego and superego,"]],[2907,["by which we are not helping ourselves at all."]],[2910,["So what one has to do is to rise"]],[2912,["within oneself up to the point of Agya"]],[2915,["and try to steady your Agya."]],[2917,["There are many people have asked Me one question:"]],[2920,["“How to steady the Agya?”"]],[2925,["Agya is placed at the crossing point of our nerves"]],[2930,["and also optic thalamus. Now, so it is said that,"]],[2934,["if you have wobbling eyes, you’ll have a wobbling Agya."]],[2938,["You have to steady your eyes, you have to soothe them."]],[2942,["Now it is very, very out of date, ancient, old"]],[2948,["and all sorts of names that you call it, to a thing like that,"]],[2951,["but you must steady your eyes and steady them in such a way that"]],[2955,["it is very soothing for the eyes."]],[2958,["[That] which is the most soothing thing for the eyes"]],[2961,["is the green grass."]],[2964,["If you could see the green grass with your eyes, means you walk"]],[2969,["with your eyes on the ground,"]],[2972,["your eyes will be soothed, your Agya will be alright."]],[2975,["That’s why Christ said that,"]],[2977,["“I tell you about the adulterous eyes”."]],[2981,["He talked about adulterous eyes."]],[2983,["The eyes with which you do adultery."]],[2987,["Is a very common thing these days."]],[2989,["Every woman, a man must see; every man, a woman must see."]],[2993,["As if it is the most important job,"]],[2996,["if you have not seen one woman you are finished!"]],[2999,["I mean this is being modern. But I am an old fashioned lady,"]],[3003,["and, as at the time of Christ, He said,"]],[3006,["“You should not have adulterous eyes.”"]],[3009,["And the ones who have adulterous eyes are,"]],[3012,["no more than any other, but our Western Christians,"]],[3018,["who all the time, even in the church,"]],[3021,["even when they’re giving sermons,"]],[3023,["their eyes are moving with adultery."]],[3027,["These eyes have to be very, very pure,"]],[3030,["very, very deep and very, very loving"]],[3034,["when you want to have your Agya alright,"]],[3037,["because you receive through your eyes."]],[3039,["Say, if you have closed your eyes,"]],[3041,["you do not put your attention to anything"]],[3043,["because your eyes are closed,"]],[3044,["you are not adding more thoughts to yourself."]],[3047,["But if your eyes are open you are adding much more thoughts"]],[3051,["because everywhere the eyes go, the attention goes,"]],[3053,["and you see things and create thoughts and put in them."]],[3056,["So your attention which has to go to the Spirit,"]],[3061,["which has to go to God,"]],[3063,["which has to shine through the window of Divine:"]],[3067,["this beautiful thing is ruined"]],[3070,["by the way we use our eyes and we do not respect it."]],[3077,["There’s nothing so pure"]],[3079,["and beautiful as the grass on the ground"]],[3084,["or the ground itself, which takes our feet, which supports us,"]],[3089,["which looks after us, enriches us."]],[3093,["We should put our eyes"]],[3094,["on the Mother Earth instead of looking at every person."]],[3098,["But from Sahaja Yoga point of view,"]],[3099,["now many of you know what happens to your eyes"]],[3102,["when you look at somebody:"]],[3104,["maybe an entity might enter your eyes."]],[3108,["And it is, you’ll be amazed,"]],[3110,["that it is the play of the entity"]],[3113,["what we call this so-called flirting is."]],[3115,["I have talked about it, before also,"]],[3117,["and people didn’t like it when I told them about it,"]],[3121,["but I have seen actual entities entering from eyes to eyes."]],[3126,["I have seen very simple people who come down"]],[3129,["to such places, say in a party."]],[3132,["In a party, people are just exchanging entities"]],[3136,["from one eye to another."]],[3138,["Once it goes to another person,"]],[3140,["he puts his entity into another person,"]],[3142,["and that goes into another person."]],[3144,["All the time your attention is diverted"]],[3146,["and you feel it is attracted towards something,"]],[3150,["you do not know why it is attracted."]],[3153,["Now the certain symbols are also made like that."]],[3156,["To add up to the problems,"]],[3158,["all the society is working at it"]],[3161,["– that you should appear in such a way"]],[3162,["that every man should look at you,"]],[3167,["every woman should look at you. Why? What is the use?"]],[3171,["Supposing I look at you what do I get?"]],[3174,["What do I get by looking at a person?"]],[3178,["What is the advantage? Just looking at a person?"]],[3182,["We are wasting such a lot of energy for what?"]],[3186,["In the same way if you are walking on the roads,"]],[3190,["on, say, some, we are seeing some beautiful things, alright."]],[3194,["If you have to buy something, alright go ahead,"]],[3196,["see those things, whatever you have to select is alright."]],[3198,["But all the time just because your eyes are such,"]],[3202,["you are just doing it and you do not know the reason"]],[3206,["why you are doing like this,"]],[3207,["all the time why your eyes are wobbling."]],[3211,["And that is a sure and certain sign for a person to become mad."]],[3218,["Absolutely, that’s a sure and certain sign is,"]],[3221,["when a person is mad how do you make it out"]],[3225,["that a person is lunatic?"]],[3227,["If you see his eyes the iris in the eyes are all the time wobbling,"]],[3233,["they cannot keep it steady."]],[3235,["Or [if] they are sick they’re also,"]],[3237,["you can see that these eyes are all the time wobbling,"]],[3242,["there is no steadiness."]],[3243,["Not only this but you have seen"]],[3245,["those people who have come in the Sahaja Yoga"]],[3247,["when they close their eyes they find their eyes are flickering."]],[3252,["Their eyelids are flickering."]],[3254,["That means there’s some sort of a disturbance"]],[3256,["in the Kundalini rising."]],[3261,["Whole tension if you call it as hundred"]],[3264,["then at least 80% of it comes through our eyes."]],[3271,["Then how important it is to protect our eyes"]],[3274,["from all kind of useless activities we are doing."]],[3280,["Christ – Christ’s life shows so many aspects"]],[3288,["of how to respect others."]],[3290,["But one of them which has been very much misused"]],[3293,["throughout is that of the prostitute."]],[3299,["He saved the prostitute, He saved her no doubt."]],[3304,["But you spoil the prostitutes."]],[3308,["A good woman you make her into prostitutes."]],[3312,["You give her ideas by which she becomes a prostitute."]],[3316,["A good hussif (housewife) is turned into a prostitute"]],[3319,["by an egoistical man."]],[3321,["Young small girls who are virgins are being destroyed"]],[3328,["by your dirty glances. Do you realise this?"]],[3332,["That you are doing just the opposite what Christ had done?"]],[3336,["And you say that He saved, Christ,"]],[3338,["so even if we are prostitutes He’ll save us."]],[3340,["But why be prostitutes? This is such a stupid style of thinking."]],[3347,["That we should become prostitutes so that Christ will save us."]],[3356,["One has to think about"]],[3358,["all these things in the proper light of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3363,["Unless and until you are realised,"]],[3365,["My talk is just useless for you."]],[3368,["But once you are realised, you will know that,"]],[3371,["if you glance at someone,"]],[3373,["you might suddenly get a headache at the back,"]],[3376,["you might feel a dart has gone into your head"]],[3379,["or something has happened, you might feel that you’re blinding"]],[3382,["with somebody’s face"]],[3385,["and you will get all kinds of experiences"]],[3387,["by which you will know how important are your eyes."]],[3392,["All your nervousness and everything can be cured"]],[3396,["if you have pure eyes."]],[3398,["But it is such a vicious circle that, through your eyes,"]],[3400,["you gather all the bad, and is accumulated in the Agya"]],[3404,["and you have to clear the Agya to make the eyes clear."]],[3407,["It’s a vicious circle."]],[3409,["But it can start at a point as I said,"]],[3411,["we have to ask for forgiveness."]],[3414,["Secondly we have to bring Christ in our Agya chakra."]],[3424,["Thirdly we have to give up all drugs"]],[3427,["and all intoxicants and all smoking."]],[3430,["That happens automatically"]],[3432,["when you are a sahaja yogi, it will work out."]],[3435,["But eyes express the whole of your being, your brain,"]],[3440,["your body, your limbs everything."]],[3445,["And if your Agya is alright then your eyes are perfectly alright."]],[3453,["They emit nothing but love wherever they glance."]],[3458,["Only with a glance of your eyes you can raise the Kundalini."]],[3463,["Only with the glance of your eyes you can cure people."]],[3467,["Only with your glance you can bring joy into the destroyed"]],[3472,["and the ruined people."]],[3474,["So these eyes which you see are the windows of your being,"]],[3479,["of your heart."]],[3480,["When the Spirit is expressed through your eyes,"]],[3485,["you must have noticed yourself that,"]],[3487,["when the Kundalini rises then the eyes become dilated."]],[3492,["And a realised soul has got black eyes"]],[3496,["because they have these eyes are dilated."]],[3501,["At least when I see them they are all dilated black eyes."]],[3505,["Apart from that,"]],[3507,["a realised soul can be made out by his eyes which are sparkling,"]],[3511,["there’s a sparkle like diamonds; they"]],[3513,["sparkle all the time and you can make out from the eyes"]],[3517,["that this person is a realised soul."]],[3519,["There’s a tremendous difference between a non-realised"]],[3522,["soul’s eyes and the realised soul’s eyes."]],[3525,["So you can imagine how your Spirit sees through your eyes,"]],[3531,["but if the eyes are not pure It doesn’t stay there long."]],[3535,["So if we have to understand Christ,"]],[3538,["physically, we have to respect our eyes,"]],[3540,["mentally, we have to give up all that is impure in our mind."]],[3547,["Now, so we come to the impurities of the mind:"]],[3551,["And the impurities of mind are,"]],[3554,["I mean, there are so many poisons, you know, about."]],[3557,["I mean there are books and books written about the poisons."]],[3560,["And the psychologists are supposed to take out all your poisons."]],[3564,["I don’t know if they can do it at all."]],[3566,["But they have the worst Agya."]],[3567,["All these psychologists have the worst Agya"]],[3570,["and I don’t think they are capable of really giving any relief"]],[3575,["to people who are suffering mentally."]],[3578,["Mental sufferings are of two types."]],[3581,["Say the same thing is that one is…vibrations are so much…"]],[3592,["One type of mental troubles are"]],[3598,["where people oppress you very much"]],[3602,["– you go on bearing the cross!"]],[3606,["Now this is a very wrong idea people have about Christ."]],[3611,["Bearing the cross doesn’t mean"]],[3613,["that, anybody who tries to oppress,"]],[3616,["you should go on taking the enslavement upon yourself."]],[3621,["You’re not to enslave to anyone whatsoever."]],[3626,["Anybody who tries to make a slave out of you,"]],[3629,["you should deny it absolutely!"]],[3632,["You should say ‘hum’, ‘I am’,"]],[3634,["“Who are you to dominate me?”"]],[3637,["Anyone whether you are of a black skin,"]],[3639,["or a red skin or a yellow skin, nobody has right"]],[3644,["to dominate anyone in this whole world,"]],[3647,["and if anybody is doing it, “Oh what to do now,"]],[3650,["after all we are poor people, or we are like this"]],[3654,["or he’s supporting,” and all that:"]],[3656,["then they are running away from their duty towards themselves."]],[3661,["Such people cannot get Realisation."]],[3664,["Slaves are not going to become kings."]],[3669,["So the slavery that is supposed to be confused"]],[3674,["with bearing the cross is another confusion of modern times."]],[3681,["We have to rise in our self-respect"]],[3684,["and we have to understand that no one in this world"]],[3688,["has a right to dominate us."]],[3691,["But then what is bearing of the cross is?"]],[3695,["First of all the people of His level never suffer."]],[3700,["It’s just a joke going on. It’s a leela,"]],[3702,["it’s a play going on for them."]],[3704,["They never suffer,"]],[3709,["and even if they so-called act as suffering,"]],[3715,["they just do it because they want to do it."]],[3719,["They are not helpless people, they are not slaves."]],[3724,["And those who think that by bearing it up"]],[3727,["and by suffering it we are becoming Christians,"]],[3732,["they should know they are psychological cases."]],[3737,["And if they are crying and weeping and all the time saying,"]],[3740,["“What to do? I am in love and my lover tortures me.”"]],[3745,["You are neither in love neither you have a lover."]],[3749,["It is a kind of a psychological clubbing."]],[3752,["That he is a dominating man and you like his domination,"]],[3755,["that’s why you are together, is a simple fact."]],[3761,["So every human being has his own self-respect."]],[3768,["And he must respect his self that is the Spirit within him."]],[3774,["And nothing should dominate it."]],[3776,["Whether you belong to this country or that country,"]],[3780,["or this ‘ism’ or that ‘ism’. All this will break down."]],[3787,["Under the rule of God"]],[3789,["nobody has the right to dominate anybody’s Spirit."]],[3796,["But when you are given freedom,"]],[3798,["you go to the other side that is Mr. Ego."]],[3802,["You do not know how to use your freedom,"]],[3806,["so you try to dominate others."]],[3809,["Your freedom is [making] everybody’s freedom is in danger."]],[3813,["You are on top of everyone, and torturing everybody’s souls."]],[3817,["And you are dominating by land and by properties"]],[3822,["or by possessions."]],[3829,["So either this way or that way,"]],[3832,["mentally if you are of this category or that category,"]],[3837,["you are against yourself."]],[3841,["Just be in the centre and see for yourself."]],[3845,["Just be looking at it."]],[3848,["Are you emitting love towards another person?"]],[3853,["If you are a slave, how can you love? You cannot."]],[3861,["If you are ‘free’ and abandoned, how can you love?"]],[3871,["Love has its own bondages, very sweet and beautiful."]],[3876,["You have to live with them. You enjoy those bondages."]],[3881,["For a little child will come to your house"]],[3884,["and he will spoil your house, no doubt, and that he should do,"]],[3889,["and you should enjoy that spoiling."]],[3893,["Then your freedom, if it is challenged by a little child’s crying,"]],[3898,["then you are not wise people. This is abandonment! gs."]],[3904,["Or I would say it is loneliness,"]],[3907,["it is cutting out from the Primordial, from the Big One,"]],[3914,["from the large one that you are:"]],[3917,["is not to be able to tolerate the freedom of others."]],[3923,["A child has no freedom to cry in the house?"]],[3926,["What sort of freedom you conceive of."]],[3931,["A mother has no right"]],[3932,["to say something she wants to say about her child?"]],[3935,["Which is her duty to tell him what is right and wrong."]],[3938,["If the son does not have [the] right to eat whatever he likes"]],[3942,["in his own mother’s family"]],[3943,["then what sort of freedom do you have?"]],[3946,["It’s such a confusion of thin"]],[3950,["So this kind of freedom is just the opposite and extreme"]],[3955,["of enslavement."]],[3956,["But in the centre is love where you are bound by everyone."]],[3961,["I am bound by My children;"]],[3963,["yes, I am, I am proud of them."]],[3966,["They bound Me and I bound them too."]],[3971,["It’s a mutual bounding which we enjoy among ourselves."]],[3977,["There is such a give and take when there is such a bondage of love."]],[3983,["But do we understand the importance of bondage of love?"]],[3987,["At the slightest pretext we break it."]],[3990,["Say a wife says, “I would like to go out today”."]],[3993,["The husband has said “Why? I am very tired don’t you understand?”"]],[3998,["Or if the husband says, “I feel like eating something,”"]],[4001,["or some particular thing, he says pancake or something,"]],[4004,["a small thing. “Oh I am very tired every time you are demand…”"]],[4008,["If she could just think [that], by making that little thing,"]],[4011,["he would be so very happy."]],[4012,["She should be dying to know what he wants."]],[4015,["And he should be dying to do what she wants."]],[4017,["And then enjoy each other’s company"]],[4019,["or you are wasting all your properties"]],[4022,["that you have as human beings."]],[4025,["You don’t know how much you are wasting from each other."]],[4029,["Every moment is filled with such beautiful bondages,"]],[4034,["where exchanges are there. What have you gained?"]],[4039,["The way you are fighting, the way you are going about:"]],[4042,["what have you gained let me see?"]],[4045,["When you die you have to announce in the paper that"]],[4048,["“XYZ is dead” and you find there is nobody."]],[4051,["And you have even to pay for people to visit you"]],[4053,["when you die. This is the case today."]],[4059,["Such dryness, such emptiness, such loneliness exists."]],[4063,["What have you achieved through this?"]],[4067,["So this bondage we have to [have]."]],[4070,["And there is no question of sacrifice,"]],[4072,["the way we must sacrifice for the family."]],[4075,["What are you sacrificing?"]],[4078,["I mean if you pay for your family"]],[4081,["you get the joy out of it, that’s why you do it."]],[4086,["If you have to lead a nice good life"]],[4089,["you are not sacrificing anything"]],[4092,["but you are gaining by that, leading a good life."]],[4098,["If your wife says, “Don’t go to the pub,”"]],[4101,["and if you do not go there,"]],[4103,["then you should not say, “She is an orthodox, old fashioned"]],[4107,["this that, that and that and that.”"]],[4109,["But instead you should thank you stars that,"]],[4111,["in this modern times also that, there is somebody"]],[4113,["who’s telling you the truth."]],[4117,["Because the whole edifice has come up,"]],[4120,["do you mean to say that truth should not be told?"]],[4124,["All this is falsehood in which you are living,"]],[4127,["and if you have to be happy – come down to Reality."]],[4134,["Friends, also same thing:"]],[4136,["With the friends what sort of relations do"]],[4138,["we have with our friends? What do we expect from them?"]],[4141,["Sending them a Christmas card"]],[4145,["and then if they don’t send, feeling bad about it."]],[4151,["There are no deeper bondages, we have not lived with them."]],[4155,["If you allow our self to be bound by them,"]],[4158,["they will be bound by us."]],[4161,["You better try this."]],[4163,["Try to be bound by them, don’t be afraid of anybody else."]],[4167,["Just try to be bound by others"]],[4170,["and you’ll be amazed how much they will be giving you."]],[4173,["I am a living example of this."]],[4178,["I can tell you, I am a living example of this;"]],[4181,["I am bound by all of you."]],[4183,["If somebody says, “Mother when are you going to leave us?”"]],[4187,["No I cannot. I cannot. I am just bound by you."]],[4190,["I just do not want to leave because I love you very much."]],[4193,["How can I leave you? It’s impossible for Me."]],[4198,["So then, what do I gain out of this life?"]],[4201,["Every – thing – that – is – in – this – world!"]],[4205,["What do you want Me to get?"]],[4207,["I cannot even count what I can get out of it."]],[4211,["Immeasurable ocean."]],[4215,["I become an ocean Myself."]],[4219,["Break your ideas about your own personal"]],[4224,["freedom and liberation, [what you are doing]","is liberating your intelligence,"]],[4231,["you are liberating your own wisdom."]],[4236,["And the sweetness and the beauty"]],[4241,["which is never perishable, whether you are old or young."]],[4246,["That is going to be your own."]],[4250,["But these poisons that are being built outside and inside you,"]],[4254,["please throw them away. These are mental poisons."]],[4261,["Through Agya you can take them out."]],[4264,["You see, this is an opening also through which many things go out."]],[4271,["Try to work it out."]],[4273,["Look at the tree with love"]],[4278,["and you’ll find that the tree itself is giving you the joy"]],[4282,["of its creation. Because you’ll become thoughtless."]],[4286,["And the Creator who has made that beautiful tree"]],[4289,["will be pouring all that joy which is stored into it."]],[4293,["Every human being is a store of joy, unlimited!"]],[4300,["I assure you, believe Me."]],[4303,["And don’t waste them because somebody is not properly dressed,"]],[4309,["or he’s not according to the way you want him to be:"]],[4313,["which you learnt in your public school!"]],[4317,["Every doorstep, everywhere there is beauty lying,"]],[4322,["do not miss it."]],[4324,["But if you have a possessiveness about it, an adultery about it,"]],[4332,["then you can never enjoy them,"]],[4337,["you can never enjoy all that beauty, all that store,"]],[4341,["all that wealth that is in every human being:"]],[4347,["every moment it is bubbling."]],[4351,["For Agya it’s a good thing, Christmas is coming."]],[4355,["And at the time that, when I have to wish you a Happy Christmas,"]],[4360,["that, at this occasion,"]],[4363,["I am speaking about Agya chakra in which,"]],[4367,["what I said is, Agya is:"]],[4369,["one must know what to order and how to obey,"]],[4374,["obey the Divine, obey your elders, obey your Self"]],[4382,["and not your ego – and then you can order also others;"]],[4389,["not only human beings, but you can even order The Sun"]],[4393,["and The Moon and all the winds and everything in the world."]],[4398,["Everything you can control, everything with this Agya."]],[4402,["You try one thing."]],[4404,["If you know somebody is going to do something wrong,"]],[4407,["just take his name and put it to Agya: He’ll not do it. Try it!"]],[4414,["This is a trick I’m telling about"]],[4416,["for those who are realised souls not for those"]],[4419,["who are not yet realised. But those who are realised can try."]],[4422,["If the other person is doing something wrong you can try your Agya."]],[4425,["Anything you order on your Agya will be respected"]],[4429,["but your Agya must have Christ there."]],[4431,["Because you have The Great Support awakened within you,"]],[4437,["which does not exist [only] here, but into every man’s head."]],[4443,["It is all pervading, into all small atoms and molecules,"]],[4447,["it is everywhere into The Sun and any place you go."]],[4450,["It is there."]],[4454,["So try to develop your Agya, that is the mastery of your self."]],[4461,["Those who have a good Agya can master anything."]],[4465,["And understand that the idea about mastering worldly things"]],[4470,["and mastering human beings and mastering this"]],[4472,["and some of them are mastering in, say, other crafts and things,"]],[4477,["best thing is to master your Agya!"]],[4480,["And you really become the master of yourself"]],[4484,["by which you can master many things."]],[4486,["And today on this great day when I’m wishing you a Happy Christmas,"]],[4491,["I wish you to have the most powerful Agya,"]],[4497,["that people, when they see your forehead"]],[4500,["should know that Christ is reborn again with in you."]],[4503,["May God bless you!"]],[4509,["We not have any programs after days, I’m sorry."]],[4512,["Because I’m going to India."]],[4514,["I’m going on the 7th, the 9th back…"]],[4517,["I think in the end of march,"]],[4519,["all of you who have been here who have got realization"]],[4522,["and have not got realization"]],[4523,["should know that it is very subtile thing"]],[4526,["which has worked within you,"]],[4528,["and it has helped all of you every way."]],[4531,["So, we have also an ashram."]],[4533,["The address of the ashram will be now told to you,"]],[4537,["so that you note it down for yourself, where is the ashram."]],[4540,["It is very near to the Dolli Hills station (not clear)."]],[4543,["Please go and meet those people."]],[4545,["And meet your brothers and sisters who are there,"]],[4547,["and there is a telephone number will be there."]],[4550,["Please contact them, and keep the contact."]],[4552,["Another thing is that we are going to have"]],[4555,["a new years day celebration."]],[4557,["Having all of us lunch together"]],[4559,["and you are all invited to be there about twelfe thirty or so."]],[4564,["And we will have some lunch and some music and some,"]],[4567,["meeting togehter and the boundage part of it."]],[4569,["Thank you very much."]],[4571,["May God Bless You!"]]]);
